cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CemCT in your research, please cite the software and the
  associated software publication.
type: software
title: >-
  CemCT: An open-source post-segmentation XRµCT data analysis package for
  cementitious materials
abstract: >-
  CemCT is a Python package for quantitative post-segmentation analysis of
  binary and integer-labelled three-dimensional X-ray micro-computed
  tomography datasets of cementitious materials. It provides user-defined
  phase-fraction analysis, pore connectivity analysis, local-thickness-based
  pore-size analysis, finite-difference diffusion analysis, random-walk
  transport analysis, pore-network extraction and intrinsic-permeability
  estimation.
